WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:08.007
[theme music playing]

01:03.313 --> 01:05.982
GENIE, MAKE A WISH

01:10.403 --> 01:12.322
KI KA-YOUNG
I STILL CAN'T REACH YOU

01:12.405 --> 01:13.948
CAN YOU CALL ME? IT'S URGENT

01:14.032 --> 01:17.077
JULY 19
I'M GETTING TRANSFERS FROM YOUR ACCOUNT

01:17.160 --> 01:19.120
SEPTEMBER 15
ARE YOU TRYING TO FUCK ME OVER?

01:19.954 --> 01:21.581
NOTICE OF DISMISSAL

01:21.664 --> 01:24.250
PLEASE RETURN YOUR ID
AND YOUR LOCKER AND BUILDING KEYS

01:24.334 --> 01:25.668
[gasps]

01:26.669 --> 01:27.879
-[knock on door]
-[gasps]

01:27.962 --> 01:29.756
[woman] I'm here
to take your meter readings.

01:31.049 --> 01:32.383
Is anyone home?

01:34.511 --> 01:36.429
[sighs] This is driving me crazy.

01:36.971 --> 01:38.056
For fuck's sake.

01:38.807 --> 01:40.725
Where did all that money come from?

01:41.226 --> 01:43.478
Why is it here?

02:01.663 --> 02:02.872
[pants, exclaims]

02:02.956 --> 02:05.208
I'm not out of breath.
Not even close to exhausted.

02:06.835 --> 02:09.045
[laughing]

02:09.838 --> 02:11.840
[solemn music plays]

02:34.904 --> 02:36.906
[alarm ringing]

02:45.707 --> 02:47.500
[melancholy music plays]

03:06.102 --> 03:07.562
[water trickling]

03:25.163 --> 03:27.123
STOP TAKING THE SLEEPING PILLS

03:27.206 --> 03:29.959
JUST TAKE 1 VITAMIN
AND GET LOTS OF SUNSHINE

03:36.466 --> 03:39.594
[Pan-geum] Even if you're feeling lazy,
try to cook your meals.

03:39.677 --> 03:42.138
The pipes freeze when it gets cold out,

03:42.222 --> 03:44.349
so make sure to wrap them
with old clothes.

03:44.849 --> 03:47.894
My darling Ka-young,
you're beautiful today as always.

03:49.187 --> 03:52.649
My dear bundle of joy, be well.

03:56.778 --> 03:58.404
[footsteps approaching]

04:01.741 --> 04:04.661
I know you're in a bad place right now,
but please help me.

04:09.457 --> 04:11.417
There's a bag full of cash in my house.

04:11.501 --> 04:13.461
I don't know how it ended up in my hands,

04:13.544 --> 04:16.422
but I saw you with it
on Choi Min-ji's Instagram.

04:17.298 --> 04:18.132
[gasps]

04:20.885 --> 04:22.220
[Bo-gyeong] It's yours, isn't it?

04:24.097 --> 04:25.139
Did I, by chance,

04:26.933 --> 04:28.184
steal your money?

04:30.603 --> 04:33.398
It's just that
I really can't remember. [sighs]

04:34.482 --> 04:36.442
[exhales] But knowing me, I could have.

04:36.526 --> 04:39.404
I envied you
and hoped you would be ruined.

04:43.324 --> 04:44.867
If I really did do that…

04:46.995 --> 04:48.246
I'm truly sorry.

04:51.332 --> 04:52.875
That money is yours.

04:54.377 --> 04:56.713
You sold me something invaluable.

04:57.880 --> 04:59.215
You helped someone.

05:00.174 --> 05:01.884
But I wasn't able to save them.

05:03.303 --> 05:04.679
So use it however you want.

05:05.471 --> 05:08.933
No, the last few days
have been absolute hell for me.

05:09.017 --> 05:10.810
I was scared someone would come for it,

05:10.893 --> 05:13.187
but reporting it to the cops
seemed like a waste.

05:13.271 --> 05:15.273
Not that I could bring myself to use it.

05:15.815 --> 05:19.736
[sighs] So please, just take it all back.

05:21.279 --> 05:22.780
But about me being fired,

05:23.406 --> 05:25.283
could you help clear things up?

05:25.867 --> 05:27.744
All I want…

05:30.538 --> 05:32.165
is to live as I was before.

05:34.125 --> 05:35.543
The Genie was right.

05:38.921 --> 05:40.923
I corrupted you.

05:44.302 --> 05:46.304
[solemn music plays]

06:11.287 --> 06:12.705
[sighs]

06:14.457 --> 06:15.917
Grandma said that?

06:17.251 --> 06:18.294
[Min-ji] Yes.

06:20.838 --> 06:22.757
She wanted me to tell you

06:23.341 --> 06:24.717
she was happy to raise you.

06:25.301 --> 06:27.637
I should have told you at the funeral.

06:30.139 --> 06:31.390
I'm sorry.

06:32.266 --> 06:33.476
For what I said then.

06:35.186 --> 06:36.270
At the time…

06:40.983 --> 06:43.653
-[sniffles] You'll forgive me, won't you?
-Yes.

06:49.325 --> 06:51.744
-Did you say you've done it all?
-[Min-ji] Of course.

06:52.912 --> 06:54.247
I accomplished everything.

06:54.997 --> 06:57.583
First, university.
Then, I became a dentist.

06:58.876 --> 07:00.128
But why do you ask?

07:01.003 --> 07:03.214
Grandma was happy while raising me.

07:04.590 --> 07:05.883
You've accomplished everything.

07:08.594 --> 07:09.720
I also

07:10.763 --> 07:12.056
want to do it all.

07:15.518 --> 07:16.894
What do you want to do?

07:21.774 --> 07:23.317
What could you possibly want to do?

07:25.027 --> 07:27.029
[melancholy music playing]

07:42.503 --> 07:43.337
[sighs]

08:12.033 --> 08:12.992
[sighs]

08:32.803 --> 08:35.723
-[engine starts]
-Ka-young!

08:37.433 --> 08:40.102
Ka-young, no! Don't go, Ka-young!

08:40.603 --> 08:41.646
[Min-ji screams]

08:42.855 --> 08:47.193
-[yells] Hey, don't leave me behind!
-[engine revving]

08:47.276 --> 08:51.489
[sobbing] Ka-young! No.

08:51.572 --> 08:53.574
[somber music playing]

09:21.894 --> 09:23.896
[distant gusting]

09:30.361 --> 09:31.320
[panting]

09:34.490 --> 09:36.450
[yelps, grunts]

09:41.581 --> 09:43.583
[groans, pants]

09:59.015 --> 10:00.891
[yelling] Come on out, Iblis!

10:00.975 --> 10:02.268
Show yourself!

10:02.351 --> 10:03.644
[panting]

10:05.021 --> 10:08.024
You said you could never leave me!

10:10.735 --> 10:12.737
[music continues]

10:48.773 --> 10:50.566
[yelling] Come out!

10:51.567 --> 10:53.194
I said show yourself!

10:53.277 --> 10:55.696
Come out, Iblis!

10:56.280 --> 10:57.490
Show yourself!

10:59.367 --> 11:01.202
Where are you?

11:01.285 --> 11:05.706
Why have you disappeared? Why? [wails]

11:21.889 --> 11:23.182
[wearily] Iblis.

11:24.892 --> 11:26.352
I said show yourself.

11:27.478 --> 11:29.480
[music continues]

11:40.866 --> 11:42.618
[yells] Iblis!

11:47.039 --> 11:48.958
[whooshing]

11:49.542 --> 11:51.544
[music fades out]

12:03.139 --> 12:05.141
[panting]

12:09.353 --> 12:12.231
What took you so long?
Do you know how long I searched for you?

12:13.232 --> 12:14.608
Why didn't you answer me?

12:15.234 --> 12:17.027
You should've come when I called.

12:22.283 --> 12:23.534
You're a Genie.

12:24.660 --> 12:27.705
You still need to grant my final wish.

12:28.914 --> 12:29.915
[breath trembles]

12:32.168 --> 12:33.878
-I will…
-Don't do it.

12:33.961 --> 12:37.339
I'll make an incredibly selfish wish.
Just for me.

12:39.300 --> 12:41.927
[inhales] Ki Ka-young, please.

12:42.803 --> 12:46.140
I want to understand my grandma's pain,
raising a stone as if it were a jewel.

12:47.933 --> 12:52.521
I want to know the fear my neighbors felt
raising me, even as they judged me.

12:53.898 --> 12:56.567
I want to understand
Min-ji's selfless friendship.

12:57.818 --> 13:01.155
I want to know the depth of the words
you wrote all over your lamp.

13:04.200 --> 13:06.118
Allow me to have humanity.

13:08.662 --> 13:09.580
For a day.

13:10.664 --> 13:11.832
For just one day,

13:13.417 --> 13:17.421
give me what they call feelings
in their normal, purest form.

13:19.673 --> 13:22.218
When that day passes,
I'll go back to being a negative one.

13:23.344 --> 13:25.095
Someone who is condemned by all.

13:26.639 --> 13:27.848
A bothersome stone.

13:29.266 --> 13:30.351
That's how I'll die.

13:33.938 --> 13:34.813
This…

13:35.773 --> 13:36.774
[Iblis's breath trembles]

13:37.566 --> 13:39.109
is my final wish.

13:42.780 --> 13:45.407
[Iblis sobs softly]

13:45.491 --> 13:47.493
[somber music plays]

13:49.078 --> 13:50.037
You…

13:52.206 --> 13:54.667
So you believe I'm capable of killing you.

13:55.709 --> 13:56.669
So this…

13:58.295 --> 14:00.422
This is the method of death you've chosen.

14:00.965 --> 14:03.425
I know. That included.

14:04.301 --> 14:05.719
I am very…

14:07.888 --> 14:08.973
very selfish.

14:12.142 --> 14:14.061
So I hope you complete your revenge…

14:16.564 --> 14:17.898
and gain freedom.

14:19.066 --> 14:20.234
[breathes shakily]

14:23.487 --> 14:26.115
To the very end,
you make wishes for others' benefit.

14:38.544 --> 14:39.962
At long last, I finally see.

14:41.714 --> 14:43.048
You were right.

14:45.926 --> 14:47.595
Your noble creation.

14:49.346 --> 14:51.807
I bow my head before this pure human.

14:51.891 --> 14:53.893
[pleasant music plays]

14:55.519 --> 14:56.520
[exhales softly]

15:28.135 --> 15:30.137
I will no longer be in your memories.

15:34.058 --> 15:36.393
You, the one I love. [breathes shakily]

15:38.938 --> 15:40.689
The only human I've ever respected.

15:46.820 --> 15:47.821
My master.

15:51.450 --> 15:52.493
[Iblis sobbing]

15:56.622 --> 15:57.873
Farewell.

15:57.957 --> 15:59.959
[enchanting music plays]

16:13.931 --> 16:15.933
[music fades out]

16:16.475 --> 16:18.102
It has been fulfilled. [inhales]

16:19.979 --> 16:21.981
[melancholy music plays]

16:32.074 --> 16:33.701
[high-pitched chiming]

16:37.579 --> 16:39.581
[gasping]

16:40.666 --> 16:42.668
[thudding]

16:45.796 --> 16:47.631
This is "gi-yeok."

16:47.715 --> 16:49.508
"Ni-eun."

16:50.300 --> 16:52.302
[gasping]

16:54.680 --> 16:56.557
Thanks! And congratulations.

16:56.640 --> 16:57.850
-Congratulations.
-Oh, boy.

16:59.810 --> 17:01.395
-[sniffles]
-[cries]

17:02.396 --> 17:04.940
I still love you either way.

17:05.983 --> 17:06.984
[gasps]

17:08.986 --> 17:12.990
[Pan-geum] Oh, boy,
my dear Ka-young is warm.

17:13.615 --> 17:16.410
My dear crybaby is so warm.

17:16.493 --> 17:18.704
My stubborn darling is warm.

17:20.622 --> 17:22.624
[sobbing]

17:24.668 --> 17:25.794
Grandma.

17:28.422 --> 17:30.716
[sobbing]

17:32.968 --> 17:34.803
[young Ka-young]
Ow! I'm going to kill you!

17:34.887 --> 17:37.473
-I'll kill you, Grandma!
-[cries]

17:38.807 --> 17:41.143
[Ka-young crying]

17:43.645 --> 17:44.938
Grandma!

17:45.022 --> 17:46.648
[exclaims, sobs]

17:49.777 --> 17:52.571
[Pan-geum] Grandma hopes that
my darling Ka-young,

17:53.072 --> 17:55.282
that you, my dear bundle of joy,

17:55.365 --> 17:57.618
will cry your heart out with longing.

17:57.701 --> 17:59.161
Try to hold it in for a minute.

17:59.244 --> 18:01.872
That you will burst out laughing with joy.

18:01.955 --> 18:03.540
That's what I want for you.

18:06.376 --> 18:10.756
[inhales] I grew up in Grandma's love.

18:11.632 --> 18:12.925
[sobs]

18:14.384 --> 18:20.891
[crying] I thrived as she withered away.

18:23.393 --> 18:27.523
[inhales, wails] No, this can't be.

18:30.192 --> 18:32.861
I was not Grandma's strength.

18:33.987 --> 18:36.698
So that was Grandma's truth.

18:38.450 --> 18:40.744
I was Grandma's burden.

18:42.287 --> 18:43.789
[cries]

18:43.872 --> 18:45.582
[Pan-geum] This is hope.

18:46.083 --> 18:47.668
The face of hope.

18:47.751 --> 18:49.753
[melancholy music playing]

18:53.465 --> 18:56.677
[wails] Grandma.

18:58.053 --> 19:01.265
Grandma! Oh no!

19:03.058 --> 19:07.187
[wailing] I'm so sorry, Grandma!

19:09.523 --> 19:11.817
Please, no…

19:13.235 --> 19:17.281
Grandma! [sobbing]

19:26.582 --> 19:28.584
[whooshes]

19:31.753 --> 19:33.589
How? Why is it you're…

19:33.672 --> 19:34.756
How come you lost?

19:36.425 --> 19:38.385
Ki Ka-young said
she'd make a selfish wish,

19:38.468 --> 19:40.095
so you should have taken revenge.

19:40.179 --> 19:41.680
That was the bet you two made.

19:43.015 --> 19:45.142
Ki Ka-young's lifespan was until tomorrow.

19:46.560 --> 19:47.561
What did you say?

19:49.479 --> 19:51.440
-Shaytan!
-[thuds]

19:52.149 --> 19:54.985
-Keep your promise to Him.
-[breath trembles]

19:56.236 --> 19:58.822
"The day that Iblis bows his head
before a human,

19:58.906 --> 20:00.866
you, Ejllael, shall slit his throat."

20:02.618 --> 20:04.328
Please ask Him for grace just this once.

20:04.411 --> 20:07.581
Tell Him that she has done nothing wrong.

20:08.582 --> 20:10.167
Please, I beg of you, Brother.

20:10.792 --> 20:13.128
[Ejllael] Everything is as he intended.

20:14.171 --> 20:17.716
I shall now execute the order
I've waited 1,000 years for.

20:17.799 --> 20:20.135
[suspenseful music plays]

20:21.720 --> 20:22.763
[clangs]

20:22.846 --> 20:24.514
[breath trembling]

20:24.598 --> 20:26.850
[metallic clang]

20:26.934 --> 20:28.936
[intense orchestral music playing]

20:38.070 --> 20:40.072
[sobbing]

20:59.383 --> 21:01.885
I am one who has seen all of your lives.

21:03.011 --> 21:05.180
I will now return to white smoke.

21:05.722 --> 21:07.516
This is my apology…

21:09.518 --> 21:11.270
as well as another of my sins.

21:12.688 --> 21:14.940
You have forgotten
something very precious.

21:15.482 --> 21:16.608
I intend to return

21:17.901 --> 21:19.069
those memories to you.

21:26.368 --> 21:27.452
[pants wearily]

21:29.204 --> 21:30.831
[blowing]

21:30.914 --> 21:32.916
[chiming]

21:49.349 --> 21:50.684
[blows]

21:53.520 --> 21:55.522
[hopeful music plays]

22:03.989 --> 22:04.865
[chuckles softly]

22:06.992 --> 22:08.327
[chuckles]

22:08.410 --> 22:10.203
[Iblis] I will remember you,
no matter what.

22:13.832 --> 22:14.708
My love.

22:17.419 --> 22:19.421
[chimes]

22:21.298 --> 22:22.632
[blows]

22:31.224 --> 22:33.226
[panting softly]

22:38.899 --> 22:41.985
-[gasping]
-[whooshes]

22:44.112 --> 22:45.405
Iblis.

22:48.784 --> 22:50.368
I had forgotten you.

22:53.747 --> 22:54.623
You could not…

22:57.417 --> 22:59.169
bring yourself to kill me.

23:02.923 --> 23:04.674
Because you love me.

23:06.426 --> 23:07.344
[sobs]

23:08.178 --> 23:09.304
You…

23:10.764 --> 23:12.349
Because of me, you…

23:16.853 --> 23:20.148
[sniffles] Your throat
must have been slit.

23:20.857 --> 23:24.319
[sobs, wails]

23:26.696 --> 23:29.366
I hoped you would be free.

23:30.200 --> 23:32.202
I hoped for you to live.

23:33.078 --> 23:35.163
That's why I did what I did.

23:36.581 --> 23:39.209
[exclaims] How can this be?

23:40.460 --> 23:44.005
[wailing]

23:48.552 --> 23:52.180
No, this can't be.

23:52.889 --> 23:55.183
This can't be!

23:57.769 --> 23:59.771
[wails]

24:02.816 --> 24:04.818
[melancholy music playing]

24:20.792 --> 24:21.835
[breathing softly]

25:12.510 --> 25:15.055
[woman] This is the Korean
Consulate General in Dubai.

25:15.138 --> 25:18.225
We regret to inform you
of the death of Ms. Ki Ka-young.

25:22.145 --> 25:25.232
[sobbing]

25:36.993 --> 25:38.161
So a psychopath

25:39.913 --> 25:41.373
died while crying?

25:42.916 --> 25:44.542
Some say that extreme sorrow

25:45.126 --> 25:46.962
can be fatal.

25:47.045 --> 25:48.713
[tearfully] Even so, a psychopath

25:49.422 --> 25:51.341
could have just gone on living.

25:51.925 --> 25:52.759
[sniffles]

25:53.718 --> 25:54.678
Goodness.

25:55.637 --> 25:56.972
My thoughts exactly.

25:57.555 --> 26:00.892
Let's get all the funeral arrangements
in place before Dr. Choi gets back.

26:00.976 --> 26:03.812
[Chang-sik] We're wearing
our funeral clothes too often.

26:14.072 --> 26:16.283
The body is ready to be returned.

26:17.367 --> 26:21.329
These are the only personal items
we were able to retrieve.

26:35.844 --> 26:37.304
THURSDAY, OCTOBER 31, 2024

26:37.387 --> 26:39.055
KI KA-YOUNG
CREMATION UNDERWAY

26:42.559 --> 26:44.644
[crying softly]

26:44.728 --> 26:46.813
[somber instrumental music playing]

26:50.608 --> 26:54.529
-[man] Thursday, October 31.
-[sobs]

26:55.196 --> 26:58.450
[man] We will now proceed
to send her off in peace.

27:05.206 --> 27:07.751
[inhales, yells] Fire!

27:09.294 --> 27:12.088
[crying] It's hot, so hurry out!

27:14.716 --> 27:15.717
Fire!

27:16.259 --> 27:17.677
It's a fire!

27:18.428 --> 27:20.889
[sobbing] Fire!

27:21.431 --> 27:23.725
[wailing] Get out of there, Ka-young!

27:23.808 --> 27:25.769
I'm sorry, Ka-young!

27:27.354 --> 27:29.189
It's too hot in there, so please…

27:30.315 --> 27:34.486
[Iblis] I am a spirit
created by smokeless fire,

27:34.569 --> 27:35.612
a Genie.

27:36.696 --> 27:42.369
We were created on Thursday,
the day after the angels were made.

27:52.253 --> 27:54.964
GOBLIN STATIONERY

27:57.217 --> 27:59.260
CLOSED TEMPORARILY
DUE TO PERSONAL REASONS

28:02.597 --> 28:05.558
CHEONGPUNG HUMAN RESOURCES OFFICE

28:09.979 --> 28:11.981
[music fades out]

28:15.693 --> 28:16.653
[sighs]

28:20.824 --> 28:21.658
[deep sigh]

28:22.450 --> 28:27.497
THE LATE KI KA-YOUNG

28:28.081 --> 28:28.957
[sobs]

28:33.294 --> 28:34.129
[exhales]

28:36.089 --> 28:37.966
[sobbing]

28:38.049 --> 28:41.594
-[whooshing]
-[coughs]

28:42.178 --> 28:44.055
[sniffles, coughs]

28:44.139 --> 28:45.932
[female voice] Tell me your wishes.

28:46.933 --> 28:49.310
O master of mine.

28:50.186 --> 28:52.731
[shrieks] Ka-young!

28:53.440 --> 28:54.482
[exclaims]

28:55.859 --> 28:56.693
[gasping]

28:56.776 --> 28:58.778
[enchanting music plays]

29:02.657 --> 29:03.742
So you're saying

29:03.825 --> 29:07.370
that after a 1,000-year love,
you also become a jinniya?

29:09.956 --> 29:11.040
Then where did that person…

29:11.791 --> 29:15.378
I mean, where did that Genie go?

29:16.337 --> 29:18.089
To eternal solitude.

29:20.258 --> 29:23.344
Didn't you bring those for me?

29:23.428 --> 29:25.722
I have to give you something
in exchange for wishes?

29:26.973 --> 29:27.974
Right.

29:29.017 --> 29:30.769
You gave Beul-li
a thousand big ones, right?

29:31.352 --> 29:32.437
Just a moment.

29:32.520 --> 29:34.606
-Are you going to make your wish now?
-Can't I?

29:34.689 --> 29:36.483
[quirky music plays]

29:36.566 --> 29:39.194
No. Those are the rules, so fine.

29:40.528 --> 29:41.529
[grunts]

29:46.117 --> 29:47.911
No bringing back the dead.

29:48.953 --> 29:50.288
No traveling to the future.

29:50.872 --> 29:53.374
Anything besides that,

29:54.209 --> 29:55.627
your wish

29:56.336 --> 29:59.881
-is my command.
-[Min-ji] Ugh!

30:00.632 --> 30:01.966
Your speech sucks.

30:05.136 --> 30:05.970
Fine.

30:06.054 --> 30:09.390
For starters, as my first wish,
eat seafood stew with me every Wednesday.

30:09.474 --> 30:11.851
[sighs, clears throat]

30:13.520 --> 30:16.731
-[energy surges]
-It's been fulfilled.

30:16.815 --> 30:18.191
As my second wish,

30:18.274 --> 30:20.944
send any neighborhood children in need
to my dental clinic.

30:21.569 --> 30:23.530
They don't go to the dentist
because of the cost.

30:23.613 --> 30:25.865
-[sighs]
-And my final wish is…

30:25.949 --> 30:26.950
Right now? You can't!

30:27.951 --> 30:29.619
Why would you use them all at once?

30:30.203 --> 30:32.789
Of course I won't. I'll save it.

30:32.872 --> 30:33.832
Phew.

30:33.915 --> 30:36.167
Just these two to start.
They're my wishes.

30:36.251 --> 30:38.002
[chimes]

30:38.086 --> 30:40.296
They will be fulfilled, Choi Min-ji.

30:40.380 --> 30:41.881
Call me "Master."

30:43.716 --> 30:45.802
KING ARCADE

30:49.764 --> 30:50.890
SMILE DENTAL CLINIC

30:50.974 --> 30:53.434
ODD TEETH AND ODD PEOPLE WELCOME

30:53.518 --> 30:54.686
Oh?

30:58.189 --> 31:00.066
Isn't this an arcade?

31:00.149 --> 31:01.734
Yes, it is an arcade.

31:01.818 --> 31:04.654
Shall we go have fun
fighting off cavity bacteria together?

31:06.114 --> 31:08.241
By the way, I heard your grades are awful.

31:08.324 --> 31:09.367
Excuse me?

31:09.450 --> 31:11.578
Solve all of these problems
while you wait.

31:14.163 --> 31:16.875
If you don't, I'll treat you
without anesthesia.

31:17.458 --> 31:18.293
[chuckles]

31:19.127 --> 31:22.630
[Ka-young] I'm guessing you're hearing
what I'm saying now in Korean.

31:23.798 --> 31:27.844
That's because I'm a jinniya
who can't speak any foreign languages.

31:28.595 --> 31:33.141
From now on, you will have to tune in
to K-pop and binge-watch K-dramas.

31:33.224 --> 31:35.226
[upbeat pop music playing]

31:40.189 --> 31:43.860
[Ka-young] Because there's a new jinniya
in town, and she doesn't speak Arabic.

31:45.528 --> 31:49.824
[Da-jin] This year, we're back at
the Cheongpungho Cherry Blossom Festival!

31:49.908 --> 31:53.036
Our village's pride and joy,
Puffed Five Grains. Ah!

31:53.828 --> 31:55.747
-Now to the next booth.
-[Yeong-hyeon] Okay.

31:56.831 --> 31:58.958
Here, we have For Daughter Strawberry!

31:59.042 --> 32:01.044
-[Da-jin and Yeong-hyeon] Strawberry!
-[chuckles]

32:03.838 --> 32:05.465
[mouthing]

32:07.091 --> 32:09.218
Hello, we are from Cheongpungho Bank.

32:09.302 --> 32:11.012
Please drop by for a consultation.

32:12.555 --> 32:14.474
[tools clanging]

32:14.557 --> 32:15.892
Ki Ka-young.

32:16.559 --> 32:18.770
-[Ka-young] You're here.
-Ah.

32:18.853 --> 32:22.106
Every time I see you like this,
my heart drops.

32:22.190 --> 32:23.691
Folks really won't recognize you?

32:25.610 --> 32:27.779
They all see me with a different face,

32:28.571 --> 32:30.031
which is quite unfortunate.

32:32.200 --> 32:33.368
I'm so pretty.

32:35.828 --> 32:38.957
[sighs] And yet, I still believe
in science after all this.

32:42.335 --> 32:43.378
Come take a look.

32:51.177 --> 32:54.055
If you thought you'd be safe this year,
you thought wrong.

32:59.102 --> 33:01.104
[exploding]

33:04.691 --> 33:06.985
AS SEXY
FUCK YOU

33:07.068 --> 33:09.070
[gentle music plays]

33:13.366 --> 33:16.202
KI KA-YOUNG
YOU'RE IN MY HEART

33:16.285 --> 33:17.787
[in Korean] I dropped some cash.

33:31.968 --> 33:33.553
-[gasps softly]
-[sniffles]

33:40.309 --> 33:45.231
[Min-ji] I've always imagined
what I would do if you died,

33:45.314 --> 33:47.734
but I was completely unprepared

33:47.817 --> 33:50.653
for what to do if you cried.

33:51.446 --> 33:53.322
So I thought about it for a few days.

33:54.907 --> 33:55.867
And?

33:57.535 --> 33:58.453
And

33:58.995 --> 34:01.622
whether you're a jinniya or a spirit,

34:02.415 --> 34:06.544
I just want you to always be happy
in this newfound life of yours.

34:10.923 --> 34:14.385
Don't cry and don't die.

34:17.680 --> 34:19.098
Reunite with the one you miss most.

34:22.977 --> 34:24.812
This is my third wish.

34:24.896 --> 34:27.690
No, Choi Min-ji, you can't.
You'll end up forgetting me!

34:32.111 --> 34:34.614
Oh. My body isn't glowing.

34:35.448 --> 34:36.407
What is this?

34:37.408 --> 34:39.660
Does that mean this wish
has already been fulfilled?

34:40.703 --> 34:43.748
[sighs] That's right. I met you again.

34:43.831 --> 34:45.416
[exhales] That scared me.

34:46.250 --> 34:47.376
The truth is

34:48.127 --> 34:49.629
once you make your final wish…

34:49.712 --> 34:51.089
[Min-ji] I'll be back soon.

34:51.798 --> 34:52.673
Take care.

34:53.758 --> 34:54.926
Goodbye, Ki Ka-young.

34:55.009 --> 34:57.053
[rustling]

35:01.057 --> 35:03.684
-Oh.
-[high-pitched chime]

35:06.729 --> 35:07.897
I'm sorry.

35:24.539 --> 35:26.541
[gentle ballad playing]

35:27.416 --> 35:28.334
[sighs]

36:33.357 --> 36:35.651
[light tinkling]

36:35.735 --> 36:37.737
[music continues]

36:52.668 --> 36:53.502
Grandma?

36:59.425 --> 37:02.345
-Have you come to see me?
-[chiming]

37:06.599 --> 37:07.558
Grandma!

37:18.152 --> 37:19.487
Come back to see me again.

37:21.030 --> 37:22.240
Come next spring too!

37:23.908 --> 37:25.368
Be sure to come every spring!

37:34.252 --> 37:38.923
This painting belonged to my ancestors
six generations ago.

37:39.006 --> 37:40.591
The style is quite unique.

37:40.675 --> 37:44.637
I want to authenticate it to determine
if it's a genuine Joseon dynasty artifact.

37:44.720 --> 37:46.764
We call paintings like these miindo.

37:46.847 --> 37:50.393
These portraits of beautiful women
typically have an East Asian flair,

37:50.476 --> 37:53.604
whereas this one looks like
an Egyptian painting.

37:55.064 --> 37:59.402
So many things have happened,
but I'm still assistant branch manager.

38:00.778 --> 38:03.322
I want to be poached by a rival company.

38:03.906 --> 38:05.324
This is my final wish.

38:05.408 --> 38:08.369
Tell me one crucial trade secret
of this supermarket.

38:09.412 --> 38:10.579
That's easy.

38:12.707 --> 38:15.209
-[energy surges]
-Mmm.

38:19.213 --> 38:22.425
-It has been fulfilled.
-[exhales contentedly]

38:22.508 --> 38:25.011
I shall tell you a crucial trade secret.

38:27.722 --> 38:30.099
[suspenseful music playing]

38:32.101 --> 38:34.729
They recommend displaying
Jin instant noodles at the front.

38:34.812 --> 38:38.441
[music distorts, ends]

38:48.534 --> 38:49.535
[sighs]

38:50.494 --> 38:52.872
Things must have been
really lonely for you.

38:53.914 --> 38:55.833
Everyone would forget you.

38:57.418 --> 38:59.295
And you alone would remember.

39:02.214 --> 39:03.215
It's raining

39:03.758 --> 39:05.384
flower petals.

39:07.595 --> 39:08.763
-[can crunches]
-This

39:09.805 --> 39:11.098
is the perfect moment.

39:15.186 --> 39:16.020
[sighs]

39:17.605 --> 39:20.608
-[whooshes]
-[romantic pop music playing]

40:00.981 --> 40:02.983
[music increases in tempo]

40:04.527 --> 40:06.070
[squeals]

40:07.905 --> 40:08.989
[squeals]

40:19.875 --> 40:21.502
It's been a while, lump of clay.

40:24.046 --> 40:25.214
I've missed you.

40:26.715 --> 40:28.342
How did you come back?

40:29.009 --> 40:30.302
Min-ji's wish

40:31.303 --> 40:32.930
glowed with the flower petals.

40:33.931 --> 40:36.767
I don't know how I came back either.

40:36.851 --> 40:38.352
[music ends]

40:39.103 --> 40:41.647
Come on, just move on already!

40:41.730 --> 40:44.733
Why are you messing with the system
in a foreign land?

40:44.817 --> 40:48.946
You little brat!
How dare you raise your voice!

40:49.530 --> 40:53.784
I now have nothing to fear,
even if you were to tell me I'd die again.

40:53.868 --> 40:56.287
-And I'm not scared of Hell either.
-[sighs]

40:56.370 --> 40:58.247
[Pan-geum] I don't need anything else.

40:58.330 --> 41:02.751
All you need to do is take me
to meet that boss of yours.

41:02.835 --> 41:06.464
You crazy human! Do you think
He is someone you can just meet at will?

41:07.089 --> 41:08.048
Come on.

41:08.132 --> 41:11.844
You're guaranteed a spot in Heaven.
Why refuse Heaven to stay here doing this?

41:11.927 --> 41:13.429
Heaven?

41:14.680 --> 41:15.973
I don't need Heaven.

41:16.807 --> 41:19.810
My Ka-young died and became Satan,
so what use is Heaven now?

41:19.894 --> 41:20.853
And, you…

41:21.395 --> 41:24.315
you told me the day I'd die,
so didn't you reveal divine secrets?

41:24.899 --> 41:28.444
And you told me in a roundabout way,
so I almost didn't catch on.

41:29.028 --> 41:30.738
Lucky I'm as sharp as a tack.

41:30.821 --> 41:34.325
So this is something
you absolutely must do for me.

41:34.408 --> 41:35.701
You said you were an angel.

41:35.784 --> 41:39.747
After all the havoc you've wreaked,
you should at least do me a favor. [tuts]

41:40.331 --> 41:45.211
[whines] What the hell is it
that you want?

41:47.421 --> 41:51.050
-Yes, I know that it's been loud.
-[rumbling above]

41:51.133 --> 41:53.052
Pardon? But I…

41:55.012 --> 41:55.930
Despite that…

41:56.847 --> 42:00.267
-Even so!
-[thunderclap]

42:01.018 --> 42:03.062
Yes, I understand. [sighs]

42:04.396 --> 42:05.231
So,

42:06.315 --> 42:08.817
toward Goryeo, with all my might?

42:09.360 --> 42:10.611
[twinkles]

42:12.530 --> 42:13.906
[clatters]

42:15.741 --> 42:17.660
[quirky music plays]

42:24.250 --> 42:26.168
Once again, you don't know the full story?

42:27.253 --> 42:28.796
Come on, we've just reunited.

42:29.713 --> 42:30.714
Whatever.

42:30.798 --> 42:33.676
Now I'll be claiming the title
of the world's most famous Genie.

42:33.759 --> 42:35.719
What kind of conclusion is that? No way!

42:36.971 --> 42:38.472
I'd rather die than give that up.

42:38.556 --> 42:40.057
Why not? Let me have it!

42:42.518 --> 42:43.978
I can even do this.

42:46.981 --> 42:48.148
-[cracks]
-[exclaims]

42:49.191 --> 42:51.777
-[cracks]
-[Iblis gasps] Oh.

42:53.654 --> 42:54.822
-Ha!
-Whoa!

43:00.369 --> 43:03.205
[sighs] You haven't changed a bit.

43:06.458 --> 43:07.501
Just as alarming

43:09.336 --> 43:10.462
as it is charming.

43:13.674 --> 43:14.883
[sighs, chuckles]

43:18.721 --> 43:19.638
[chuckles]

43:23.809 --> 43:27.521
Just hurry up already!
We need to get seats at the front.

43:28.689 --> 43:30.566
Why are we here at the crack of dawn?

43:31.066 --> 43:33.861
Harvesting cabbage is great.
The pay's good, and they feed you.

43:33.944 --> 43:37.573
These jobs are hard to come by
in the current job market.

43:37.656 --> 43:40.951
Look, there are already three people.
Hey, Mr. Kim. You're here.

43:42.202 --> 43:44.622
Hurry and take a seat.
I hope they need at least four people.

43:45.164 --> 43:46.540
-Have you eaten?
-Of course.

43:47.249 --> 43:49.418
Oh, dear, a young man like you.

43:49.501 --> 43:52.254
You must be having a very hard time,
mumbling to yourself like that.

43:55.299 --> 43:56.675
Only I can see you right now?

43:57.801 --> 44:00.137
[spluttering]
That is really difficult to do.

44:00.220 --> 44:03.557
It took me 11,000 years
to master that skill.

44:03.641 --> 44:06.226
Takes around 110 centuries
to learn things.

44:07.895 --> 44:08.812
Damn it.

44:09.438 --> 44:10.522
This won't do.

44:10.606 --> 44:13.150
You should wear something too.
Pray they pick us.

44:13.233 --> 44:14.068
Why should I?

44:14.151 --> 44:18.072
We need to buy you something to wear,
but you're a jinniya now, so you're broke.

44:18.656 --> 44:20.949
Broke? I have money.

44:21.742 --> 44:24.244
What? How would you have money?

44:27.206 --> 44:30.334
[Ka-young grunts, pants]

44:30.959 --> 44:33.545
-See that?
-[gasps]

44:35.631 --> 44:36.465
Wow!

44:37.841 --> 44:42.471
-Whoo! Can I have just 10,000 won?
-10,000 won?

44:44.181 --> 44:46.183
So now you're adjusting for inflation?

44:46.725 --> 44:49.937
Don't think about doing anything silly,
and go and get a haircut.

44:50.020 --> 44:51.855
You could pass as Moon Dong-eun.

44:52.606 --> 44:53.732
I have my reasons.

44:54.400 --> 44:56.235
I'm going to try to make Sade again.

44:56.819 --> 44:59.154
This time I'm using luxury hair masks

44:59.655 --> 45:02.908
and taking extra care,
so he may be born in a different form.

45:02.991 --> 45:04.827
Right, Sade told me.

45:05.327 --> 45:07.037
Fine, I understand the hair.

45:08.080 --> 45:10.040
But why did you add a teardrop?

45:10.124 --> 45:14.128
The first Sade actually died protecting me
in the 300-year war.

45:14.795 --> 45:18.799
So after the war ended, I added
a drop of my sadness and remade him.

45:18.882 --> 45:20.759
That's who you saw, the second iteration.

45:21.301 --> 45:24.221
Hmm. I should have known.
He was quite misty.

45:25.139 --> 45:28.976
So that's why I intend to keep things dry
this time around. Heh!

45:29.059 --> 45:32.938
-[chiming]
-Hey, I have a wish-maker.

45:35.149 --> 45:36.275
[giggles]

45:38.527 --> 45:39.403
[sighs]

45:39.486 --> 45:41.488
[upbeat music playing over speakers]

45:45.075 --> 45:47.244
Ooh. Mmm.

45:49.455 --> 45:50.414
Ooh.

45:51.957 --> 45:54.710
Ooh. [gasps] Oh my, you scared me!

45:56.211 --> 45:57.379
Who are you?

45:59.047 --> 46:00.132
What's with the hair?

46:01.133 --> 46:03.969
There is a reason for my hair.
Sorry for scaring you.

46:04.052 --> 46:05.471
I'm here to share good news.

46:06.889 --> 46:10.392
I am Genie, the lamp spirit.
I shall grant you three wishes.

46:11.059 --> 46:14.188
Right, so you're a fucking Genie? Okay.

46:14.771 --> 46:17.274
Is this a new scam?
How much of this was a setup?

46:17.357 --> 46:20.944
[chuckles] This is a common response.
That's why I've prepared a manual.

46:21.028 --> 46:23.655
The first page has possible wishes.
The last, impossible ones.

46:25.616 --> 46:27.034
[clears throat]

46:27.117 --> 46:28.619
WISH-MAKER'S MANUAL

46:28.702 --> 46:30.621
Be meticulous with any special terms.

46:30.704 --> 46:33.540
Immortality? [tuts] You'd regret it.
Just watch three vampire movies.

46:33.624 --> 46:34.875
Changing the past? [tuts]

46:34.958 --> 46:37.169
Butterfly effects happen,
so if you're not smart…

46:38.086 --> 46:40.172
Uh, just give up on it. [inhales sharply]

46:40.255 --> 46:44.968
If you happen to have the means, could you
buy me a beverage? [clicks tongue]

46:46.678 --> 46:50.432
-[laughs smugly] Aren't you a Genie?
-Yes.

46:50.516 --> 46:52.100
You said you'd grant my wishes.

46:52.643 --> 46:54.978
Then why the fuck
are you asking me for wishes?

46:55.562 --> 46:56.396
Oh.

46:57.898 --> 47:01.318
Didn't you once have a lot of faith in Him

47:01.401 --> 47:03.737
and, you know, have a very pure soul?

47:04.404 --> 47:06.573
Wait, do you also believe
in ancestral deities?

47:08.033 --> 47:11.078
-Oh. This will bring out my soft side.
-[laughs]

47:12.746 --> 47:15.374
There's a higher power in this realm too.
They're called diamonds.

47:15.457 --> 47:16.833
Practically deities.

47:16.917 --> 47:19.753
"Germanium jade mats"?
Right, what is this?

47:19.836 --> 47:23.382
To put it simply, it's a magic carpet
that generates heat by itself.

47:24.174 --> 47:26.510
-Like a Genie's magic ride. [laughs]
-Oh.

47:26.593 --> 47:28.554
You'd start with ten mats.

47:28.637 --> 47:31.390
Once you sell ten,
the next one's free of charge.

47:31.473 --> 47:34.226
Free? This carpet here is free?

47:34.309 --> 47:38.647
Yes. That's why there's no need
for an upfront payment.

47:38.730 --> 47:40.983
This really is a rare opportunity,
you know.

47:42.109 --> 47:43.902
-There's no upfront payment?
-Yes.

47:44.486 --> 47:46.947
Then maybe I shouldn't be going
to the cabbage patches.

47:47.656 --> 47:51.660
Wait, but if I work the cabbage patches
and do this… [exclaims]

47:53.078 --> 47:55.205
Mr. Kim, Mr. Park, Mr. Choi.

47:55.289 --> 47:56.832
Sang-hyeok, when he grows up.

47:56.915 --> 47:57.833
Ejllael…

47:58.500 --> 48:00.043
wouldn't buy one from me.

48:00.127 --> 48:01.587
Hey, could you sign here?

48:01.670 --> 48:05.215
Min-ji! Has forgotten who I am.

48:06.216 --> 48:07.134
Oh Pan-geum!

48:07.676 --> 48:09.595
Has, oh…

48:09.678 --> 48:11.388
[sighs] She's not around.

48:11.972 --> 48:14.474
This is such a great product,
but I can't sell it.

48:15.851 --> 48:17.519
I just can't think of ten people.

48:17.603 --> 48:19.271
Irem isn't here, nor is Sade.

48:20.355 --> 48:21.398
I miss Oh Pan-geum.

48:22.608 --> 48:24.610
[quirky music plays]

48:24.693 --> 48:25.819
Are you well?

48:27.112 --> 48:28.864
You're keeping an eye on us, right?

48:30.157 --> 48:31.366
I'm doing well.

48:31.450 --> 48:35.621
-I see you're lacking in many areas.
-[whimpers]

48:35.704 --> 48:38.206
-Let's just forget this altogether.
-[whimpering]

48:40.334 --> 48:41.501
Where are you going?

48:41.585 --> 48:43.754
Make a wish before you go!
I actually am a Genie!

48:44.838 --> 48:45.672
Make your wish.

48:46.256 --> 48:49.384
No bringing back the dead.
No traveling to the future.

48:50.010 --> 48:51.845
Anything besides that,

48:51.928 --> 48:53.513
your wish

48:54.640 --> 48:55.891
is my command.

48:57.893 --> 49:00.729
That way leads to a road!
Why do you always go that way?

49:13.367 --> 49:14.201
Hey.

49:15.619 --> 49:18.246
Did you use an entire bottle
of my favorite shampoo?

49:18.330 --> 49:21.792
Well, I only did that
so I could make Sade.

49:23.835 --> 49:25.379
[screams] I'm going to kill you!

49:25.462 --> 49:28.256
[both panting]

49:28.340 --> 49:29.925
-Come here.
-You come.

49:30.008 --> 49:31.510
[yells] Get over here! [pants]

49:31.593 --> 49:33.512
-[Ka-young] Come here.
-[Iblis] I don't want to.

49:33.595 --> 49:35.722
-[Ka-young] I said come here.
-I said I don't want to.

49:35.806 --> 49:37.391
[Ka-young yells] Don't talk back to me!

49:37.474 --> 49:39.267
[Iblis in high-pitch]
Don't ask me questions!

49:39.351 --> 49:41.978
Come here. I said get over here.

49:42.062 --> 49:42.938
No.

49:43.021 --> 49:44.022
No way!

49:44.106 --> 49:45.482
That little guy's back.

49:47.567 --> 49:50.112
No way. He's back too.

49:53.073 --> 49:56.451
You used an entire bottle of shampoo,
and he looks exactly the same?

49:56.993 --> 49:59.705
I felt bad because I thought
it was the state of my hair.

50:00.247 --> 50:02.374
But I feel less guilty now.

50:04.000 --> 50:04.835
Master.

50:05.419 --> 50:06.420
Boss.

50:06.962 --> 50:09.297
[wailing]

50:12.426 --> 50:15.053
I missed you guys.

50:15.137 --> 50:17.139
[laughing]

50:20.142 --> 50:20.976
[Ejllael] Come on!

50:21.059 --> 50:24.604
-[crying] Seriously, just let go of me!
-[Sade growling]

50:24.688 --> 50:28.650
Hey, do you want to be obliterated again?
I'm busy enough trying to grow new wings.

50:28.734 --> 50:31.236
[Sade] Ejllael, you're evil!

50:31.319 --> 50:34.322
Create Irem again! [growls]

50:34.406 --> 50:37.200
[yelps] Oh, come on. Please!

50:37.743 --> 50:39.619
Seriously!

50:39.703 --> 50:40.996
[blubbing]

50:43.290 --> 50:45.292
[blows]

50:45.917 --> 50:47.919
[enchanting instrumental music plays]

50:49.171 --> 50:51.506
[coughing]

50:53.633 --> 50:56.136
-Been a while, Brother.
-[coughs]

50:57.387 --> 50:58.889
I see your neck's reattached.

50:58.972 --> 51:00.974
Yeah, thanks for the congratulations.

51:01.057 --> 51:02.893
And thanks for delivering my lamp too.

51:02.976 --> 51:04.728
But why are you still on Goryeo land?

51:04.811 --> 51:06.688
I've invested in several buildings here.

51:06.772 --> 51:08.690
Land is a long-term investment.

51:09.191 --> 51:12.778
And did you know? Ki Ka-young
hasn't bowed before a human either.

51:12.861 --> 51:15.864
Nonsense. Ki Ka-young bows
at Oh Pan-geum's grave every day.

51:15.947 --> 51:18.825
Dead humans don't count! [sighs]

51:19.576 --> 51:22.204
Just thinking about those threats
from Oh Pan-geum… [inhales]

51:22.287 --> 51:23.413
Threats?

51:23.955 --> 51:26.958
I am so sick of humans.
They're always beyond imagination.

51:27.042 --> 51:31.171
She refused Heaven and reincarnation.
She just yelled at Him to revive you!

51:32.088 --> 51:33.715
Do you understand the bind I was in?

51:34.299 --> 51:35.133
[chuckles]

51:37.052 --> 51:38.011
Whoa.

51:40.138 --> 51:42.224
So I came back, thanks to Oh Pan-geum.

51:42.307 --> 51:43.141
Anyway,

51:43.642 --> 51:46.478
Oh Pan-geum asked me
to relay this to you and Ki Ka-young.

51:47.521 --> 51:48.355
Relay what?

51:49.523 --> 51:51.149
[hoots]

51:51.233 --> 51:52.734
[Irem] Sade!

51:52.818 --> 51:54.110
Jinniya!

51:54.611 --> 51:55.946
Iblis!

51:56.446 --> 51:58.782
Mr. Village Chief!

51:58.865 --> 52:01.618
GERMANIUM JADE MAT

52:06.998 --> 52:08.041
[exclaims]

52:09.042 --> 52:09.876
What is that?

52:12.546 --> 52:13.380
This?

52:13.964 --> 52:17.801
Well, I bought these a long time ago.

52:17.884 --> 52:20.387
It's a magic carpet
that generates heat on its own.

52:20.470 --> 52:23.348
If I sell ten, I get another one for free.

52:23.431 --> 52:26.434
Right, I also give you one free smack
after you get ten.

52:26.518 --> 52:28.645
-[Ka-young] Get over here.
-Just hear me out!

52:28.728 --> 52:31.356
Now that Sade and Irem are back,
I have nine people.

52:31.439 --> 52:33.149
I just need one more person. Hey!

52:33.233 --> 52:34.359
Time for a coffee break.

52:35.485 --> 52:38.613
By the way, Mr. Kim from the cabbage patch
passed away yesterday.

52:39.990 --> 52:41.283
What?

52:41.366 --> 52:43.451
Where did you get these?

52:43.535 --> 52:45.161
Did you join a pyramid scheme too?

52:45.245 --> 52:48.039
[exclaims] Hey, where did you…

52:48.123 --> 52:49.332
They look vintage, don't they?

52:49.416 --> 52:51.668
I found them
shoved in the corner of the lamp.

52:51.751 --> 52:54.170
[gasps, whines]

52:55.922 --> 52:58.758
[sniffs] But I can smell
Jinniya's scent on these.

52:58.842 --> 53:00.218
Sade, you bastard!

53:02.554 --> 53:05.640
It was an early wedding gift.
A wedding gift for you and me.

53:05.724 --> 53:08.393
-You said you couldn't go to the future.
-[pants]

53:08.476 --> 53:10.687
So you didn't see the bloody future
ahead of you?

53:10.770 --> 53:12.731
Come here. Yes, come here.

53:13.315 --> 53:15.859
-[Iblis screams]
-[Ka-young yells] Get over here!

53:16.484 --> 53:17.777
That's hot, damn.

53:24.743 --> 53:26.745
[whooshing]

53:31.499 --> 53:33.251
[man in Arabic] The sword is back?

53:40.508 --> 53:42.928
[tour guide in Korean]
Do you see that sand whirl over there?

53:43.011 --> 53:46.765
In Arabic culture, that phenomenon
is called the "waltzing Genie."

53:46.848 --> 53:48.266
Wow, a Genie?

53:48.350 --> 53:51.269
The spirit of the lamp we've all heard of?
How awesome!

53:51.353 --> 53:54.731
-[wrist watch ticking]
-[woman] Wow, that's so impressive!

53:56.316 --> 53:58.401
Dr. Choi, you're back.

53:59.653 --> 54:00.487
Yes.

54:01.696 --> 54:03.990
I just can't get enough of this place.

54:04.866 --> 54:06.868
[captivating music plays]

54:20.173 --> 54:22.175
[gentle ballad playing]

54:33.144 --> 54:35.605
We've been dancing the waltz for decades,

54:35.689 --> 54:37.440
yet you still step on my toes?

54:38.441 --> 54:41.194
I did it on purpose
so we don't forget where we started.

54:42.320 --> 54:44.239
And I have something to tell you.

54:45.281 --> 54:46.449
-Ha--
-[Ka-young] Don't!

54:48.493 --> 54:49.703
The timing is, you know?

54:52.288 --> 54:56.126
Everyone is on the edge of their seats,
thinking we might end with "habibti."

55:00.672 --> 55:03.675
I thought I could sense
some fierce gazes upon us.

55:05.301 --> 55:08.179
But I was actually
going to say "halmeoni."

55:10.098 --> 55:12.017
Hmm. That's a relief.

55:13.601 --> 55:15.687
Halmeoni? You mean my grandma?

55:16.229 --> 55:20.066
Yes. It was thanks to Oh Pan-geum
that I came back.

55:21.067 --> 55:21.985
And…

55:23.570 --> 55:25.155
she wanted to pass on that message.

55:28.742 --> 55:32.620
I SHALL NOW LEAVE YOU EACH
WITH ONE SATAN AND ONE PSYCHOPATH

55:32.704 --> 55:35.290
MAY YOU BOTH LOVE AND LONG FOR EACH OTHER

55:44.340 --> 55:45.592
-[chiming]
-Hmm?

55:47.218 --> 55:48.344
It's a wish-maker.

55:49.554 --> 55:51.473
Give it your best, psychopath.

55:52.849 --> 55:54.142
Don't worry about me.

55:54.726 --> 55:56.603
See you later, Satan.

55:57.812 --> 55:58.813
[chuckles]

56:14.871 --> 56:16.873
[gentle ballad continues]

58:01.227 --> 58:03.229
[rock fusion music plays]
